{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00293",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.62,
      "end_seconds": 3.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Hi, nice to see you. Sit down, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.64,
      "end_seconds": 5.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 6.01,
      "end_seconds": 11.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.7,
      "end_seconds": 15.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Is the form from the front desk all filled in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.32,
      "end_seconds": 20.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I think so, I handed it in at the counter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.55,
      "end_seconds": 23.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Right, what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.52,
      "end_seconds": 26.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I've been dealing with pressure in the face."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.33,
      "end_seconds": 31.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.86,
      "end_seconds": 38.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.19,
      "end_seconds": 42.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.6,
      "end_seconds": 46.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Hmm, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.43,
      "end_seconds": 50.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.78,
      "end_seconds": 59.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "It usually comes with a headache over my forehead. The headache over my forehead? That's been for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.72,
      "end_seconds": 65.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.57,
      "end_seconds": 77.7,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.91,
      "end_seconds": 86.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Have you had any vision changes, swelling around the eyes or stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.49,
      "end_seconds": 88.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.46,
      "end_seconds": 93.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.29,
      "end_seconds": 97.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.94,
      "end_seconds": 104.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.03,
      "end_seconds": 110.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed. Otrivin nasal drops. I take it twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.01,
      "end_seconds": 125.7,
      "duration_seconds": 13.69,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.79,
      "end_seconds": 128.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.19,
      "end_seconds": 131.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.78,
      "end_seconds": 133.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.98,
      "end_seconds": 142.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Okay. Right, so that's your known eczema. We'll keep that in mind today. I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.89,
      "end_seconds": 146.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.44,
      "end_seconds": 147.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.81,
      "end_seconds": 150.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.75,
      "end_seconds": 154.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.83,
      "end_seconds": 157.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.05,
      "end_seconds": 162.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.68,
      "end_seconds": 166.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, um, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.9,
      "end_seconds": 171.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.07,
      "end_seconds": 172.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.7,
      "end_seconds": 197.2,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.3,
      "end_seconds": 200.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.04,
      "end_seconds": 204.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.89,
      "end_seconds": 208.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.39,
      "end_seconds": 227.67,
      "duration_seconds": 18.28,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, this looks most like sinusitis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pressure in the face, mild, and no swelling around the eyes or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.57,
      "end_seconds": 230.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.13,
      "end_seconds": 236.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.44,
      "end_seconds": 237.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.53,
      "end_seconds": 277.72,
      "duration_seconds": 28.19,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I'm going to order an X-ray of the sinuses, for sinusitis. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'd like you to take saline nasal spray, three times a day, for one week. That should help with nasal congestion. I'm prescribing amoxicillin-clavulanate, 625 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. That should help with sinusitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.89,
      "end_seconds": 304.91,
      "duration_seconds": 26.02,
      "text": "Steam a couple of times a day and saline rinses will help clear things. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. I'd like to see you again if it's not better in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.46,
      "end_seconds": 307.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.9,
      "end_seconds": 311.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.14,
      "end_seconds": 318.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "So, I take the amoxicillin-clavulanate, 625 milligrams, twice a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.19,
      "end_seconds": 324.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.52,
      "end_seconds": 328.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}